      "problem": "Under STM roadmap measure 3.2.1, the 2029–2031 milestone is annual reports for at least five cancers, whereas the 90% data coverage indicator applies to the quality registry's data base rather than the annual reports.",
      "severity": "low"
    },
    {
      "location": "what_to_do_first.details[1]",
      "sentence": "Because the Health Care Act sets no maximum time for a cancer suspicion, the team recommends reporting access times using THL 21/2016 definitions for 16 cancers with handover alerts; meanwhile, the STM roadmap (measure 3.1.2) plans cancer-specific access times by 2026–2028, and the Filha programme's diagnostics recommendation with time limits is to be carried out before the 2030 mid-term evaluation.",
